OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire breaks out at Mitcham
OL,4,Aindustrial site
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews will continue to work
OL,7,Fovernight to fully extinguish a large
OL,8,Ffire which broke out at an industrial
OL,9,Fsite in south London, sending thick
OL,10,Fblack smoke across the area.
OL,12,FThe premises contain a workshop, tyre
OL,13,Fcentre and scaffolding yard. The fire
OL,14,Fspread to about eight hectares (nearly
OL,15,F20 acres) of surrounding scrubland, as
OL,16,Fwell as part of a house.
OL,18,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) sent
OL,19,Fabout 125 firefighters and 20 fire
OL,20,Fengines to the scene near Carshalton
OL,21,FRoad in Mitcham.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
