OL,3,GNEWSALarge fire breaks out at Mitcham
OL,4,Aindustrial site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cause of the fire is not yet known
OL,7,Fand there are currently no reports of
OL,8,Fany injuries. Multiple hotspots remain
OL,9,Falight, but the fire was declared under
OL,10,Fcontrol by the LFB at 20:28 BST.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
